# FC.io Project Rules

## Layout & Styling

### Container Usage (MANDATORY)
- **ALWAYS** wrap page content in proper container elements
- Use `.container` or `.page-container` classes for proper max-width and centering
- Apply consistent padding and margins through container classes
- Never have content flush against viewport edges
- Containers should provide responsive spacing (mobile: 1rem, tablet: 2rem, desktop: 3rem)

Example structure:
```jsx
<div className="page-container">
  <div className="content-wrapper">
    {/* Your content here */}
  </div>
</div>
```

### Component Library
- **USE shadcn/ui** - Primary UI component library (based on Radix UI + Tailwind)
- **NO Headless UI** - Completely removed from project
- Available shadcn components already installed: Select, DropdownMenu
- When adding new UI components, use shadcn/ui: `npx shadcn@latest add [component-name]`
- Use Tailwind CSS for all styling
- Components location: `src/components/ui/`

## Status Labels
Card statuses should display as:
- "Added Recently" (not "New")
- "Needs Review" (not "Learning") 
- "Due to Review" (not "Review")
- "Archived"

## General
- Use translation keys (i18n) for all user-facing text
- Maintain responsive design across mobile, tablet, and desktop
- Follow existing code patterns and file structure
